<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Duratex raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Duratex raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Santander Investment said it upgraded Duratex SA to buy from market perform.</p>
<p>-- raised the 1996 earnings estimate to US$3.56 from US$3.41.</p>
<p>-- set 12- to 18-month price target of $48.50.</p>
<p>-- cited improvement in gross margins between first and third quarters due to increased productivity from greater automation, stabilization of construction material prices, as well as strong particle board demand.</p>
</text>
